{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56811","headline":"日华月华君赠郑冠卿诗（题拟） 一 · 不详","name":"日华月华君赠郑冠卿诗（题拟） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倏忽而来蹔少留，凡间风月已三秋。\n趋名竞利何时了，害物伤人早晚休。\n祸极累成爲世谤，贵荣过却（《仙迹记》作「荣过恩却」）与身雠。\n君看虎战龙争者（《仙迹记》作「处」），几树白杨飘陇头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56811.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56811","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}